=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Despachiaire} to obtain {@k} {k:Letter from Shikaree Y}.
* Head to {z:Boneyard Gully} and select "Requiem of Sin" at the Dark Miasma to enter a battlefield.
* There is a 30 minute timer to complete the battle with up to 6 party members.
** Each party member must have their own entry Key Item.
** Although the battle is not level restricted, {p:Trusts|Trust} may not be summoned.
* This fight is against:
** {n:Shikaree X}: {p:BST}/{p:NIN}
** {m:Shikaree X's Rabbit}: Resistant to {s:sleep|Sleep} but not {s:bind|Bind} and {s:gravity|Gravity}.
*** If it is killed before {n:Shikaree X}, another one will be summoned in it's place.
** {m:Shikaree Y}: {p:DRK}/{p:MNK}
** {p:Shikaree Z}: {p:DRG}/{p:WHM}
** {m:Shikaree Z's Wyvern}: Resistant to {s:sleep|Sleep}.
* The Shikaree's are difficult to {s:sleep|Sleep} and the effect will not last long on either of them.
* They gain {p:TP} very quickly and will attempt to {p:Skillchain} with each other.
* Once all three are defeated, a treasure chest will spawn with your reward.
** The rewards are random. The rewards listed above are some of the more notable rewards.

>**{c=red:Note}**:
* A Conquest Tally must have taken place after completion of {q:Tango with a Tracker|Tango with a Tracker|Tango with a Tracker} in order to flag this quest. -- Not True as of Aug 2026.The requirement may be after acceptance of {q:Tango with a Tracker|Tango with a Tracker|Tango with a Tracker}.
* This quest can may be completed once per conquest tally. Upon repeating the quest, you will be given the {k:Letter from the Mithran Trackers} key item instead.

